# Manual API checks. Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension
# (click "Send Request"), and maps 1:1 onto Postman/Bruno requests.
# Cookies are kept between requests automatically, so run them in order.

@base = http://localhost:5050

### Register a company + its first admin (logs you in)
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/register-company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Demo Furniture",
  "company_slug": "demo-furniture",
  "full_name": "Demo Admin",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "demo password 123"
}

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/v1/auth/me

### Log in (rotates the session cookie)
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "demo password 123"
}

### Log out
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/logout

### A foreign site trying to call us -> 403 forbidden_origin
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/logout
Origin: https://evil.example
